[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C14]
Las Pegasus-Appleloosa Reciprocity Agreement

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C14_desc]
The Western Equestria Trade Alliance has just been established, but we need more resources and markets, as well as a complete industrial structure, to compete with the Empire.\nTherefore, we need to seek cooperation with Appleloosa to obtain their agricultural resources.

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C14]
洛马基-苹果鲁萨互惠协议

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_INVITE_C14_desc]
西小马国贸易同盟初步建立，我们需要更多的资源和市场，以及完整的产业结构，才能和帝国分庭抗礼。\n因此，我们需要争取苹果鲁萨的合作，获取他们的农业资源。

